      <rules>
        <rule name="Legiones Consularis" id="e22a-267b-48c2-8dd5" page="8" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599">
          <description>Any Legion Saturnine Centurion may select a single Consul upgrade; no model may take more than one such upgrade. The various Consul types are listed here, but full rules for them can be found in the Liber Astartes rulebooks:
● Legion Forge Lord................................................. +40 points ● Legion Siege Breaker ............................................ +45 points ● Legion Mortificator .............................................. +25 points</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <comment>!BSC Errors from 20240406-1603
Combi-Bolter is in two option lists for Legion Saturnine Centurion, you will need to combine them by hand.
Power Weapon is in two option lists for Legion Saturnine Centurion, you will need to combine them by hand.</comment>
    </selectionEntry>
