      <comment>!BSC Errors from 20240406-1603
The option &apos;Havoc Launcher&apos; may need a &apos;multiply by number of models&apos; modifier
Power Weapon is in two option lists for Legion Indomitus Standard Bearer, you will need to combine them by hand.
Combi-Bolter is in two option lists for Legion Indomitus Chosen, you will need to combine them by hand.
Power Weapon is in two option lists for Legion Indomitus Chosen, you will need to combine them by hand.
Power Weapon is in two option lists for Legion Indomitus Standard Bearer, you will need to combine them by hand.</comment>
